                        </div>
                        <div style="margin-top:auto;">
                            <a href={`/${slug}`} style="background:#0a5f61; color:#ffffff; padding:10px 20px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; font-size:0.9rem; display:inline-block;">Read Guide →</a>
                        </div>
